for some actors Friday Night Lights  served as a springboard for future  successes for others it was the pinnacle  of their career here is what the cast of  Friday Night Lights has been up to since  their time walking the halls of Dillon  High although playing jeff Metcalf on  ABC sitcom homefront lit the flame of  Kyle Chandler's acting career it was the  role of Eric Taylor head coach of the  Dillon Panthers football team on Friday  Night Lights that truly poured gasoline  on it as Taylor Chandler gave an  incredibly believable grounded  performance that perfectly captured a  teacher and family man the role even  earned him a well-deserved Emmy win for  lead actor in a Drama Series in 2011  after officially hanging up his whistle  in 2011 Chandler became a hot name in  Hollywood he's appeared in a slew of  well-received movies including the wolf  of Wall Street  first man and Manchester by the sea and  in 2015 he dipped back into TV starring  in Netflix's Golden Globe nominated  series bloodline while the respected  actor has enjoyed a wildly successful  decade it appears as though the Godzilla  king of the monsters star hasn't let  Fame change his priorities in a recent  interview with Men's Journal Chandler  discussed the life-changing decision to  leave Los Angeles and move his family to  a small town outside of Austin Texas in  order to focus on family life with his  wife and two daughters faces for  apparently Connie Britton was destined  to play a football coaches wife the Spin  City veteran not only played Sharon  Gaines the wife of Billy Bob Thornton's  coach games in 2004 Friday Night Lights  movie but also Tammy Taylor the high  school guidance counselor married to  coach Eric Taylor in NBC's Friday Night  Lights television series as Tami Britton  shown as a strong-willed mother and  devoted wife nabbing a pair of Emmy  nominations in 2010 and 2011 after  Friday Night Lights Britton took on the  role of Vivien Harmon on the first  season of Ryan Murphy's wild horror  series American Horror Story  although Britton was excited to play a  different type of part she was a little  nervous about some of the show's risque  scenes according to the actress I needed  to shake things up but also worried my  god what are people going to think when  they see Tammy Taylor having sex with a  man in a rubber suit  fortunately Britain's time on American  Horror  story did nothing but boost her profile  and she soon found herself starring in a  plethora of both films and television  series alike perhaps most notably as  Rayna Jaymes from CMT's mega hit  Nashville britain has also played  notable parts and shows like 930 John  and Smith as well as movies like  American ultra and bombshell so it's  safe to say she's keeping busy after  stealing America's heart playing  troubled teen with a heart of gold Tim  Riggins on Friday Night Lights Taylor  Kitsch seemed destined for the big time  while splitting time walking the halls  of Dillon high Kitsch appeared in small  roles in a couple of blockbuster action  movies including snakes on a plane and  x-men origins Wolverine but audiences  were excited to see what he could do as  a leading man unfortunately things  didn't quite pan out as expected in that  regard after Friday Night Lights rapped  Kitsch landed two leading parts the  first was as the titular character in  Disney's ambitious sci-fi blockbuster  John Carter which completely bombed in  the box office reportedly losing 200  million dollars and the other was as  lieutenant Alex hopper in battleship  which also ended up being a massive flop  while the actor bounce back with smaller  roles and successful projects like lone  survivor and HBO's True detective  Hollywood still seems hesitant to cast  him as a lead again the savages star  still gets work from Hollywood most  recently in the Chadwick Boseman led 21  bridges but much like fellow Friday  Night Lights alum Kyle Chandler he  actually lives in Austin Texas where he  spends his time playing guitar and doing  photography although he may not have  left Texas don't expect Tim Riggins to  show up in a series reboot anytime soon  he vowed in 2019 there's no way if you  want to give me twenty five million  dollars I'll do it but that's my price  it's hard to reminisce on episodes of  Friday Night Lights without Minka  Kelly's Lyla Garrity coming to mind the  Panthers cheerleader had a real girl  next door vibe about her and although  her dating exploits often muddied her  reputation she was a staple to the  series success the show catapulted Kelly  into the limelight and she was even  crowned Esquire sexiest woman alive in  2010 fresh off her Friday Night Lights  Fame Kelly starred in the 2011 horror  film  The Roommate which attempted to  capitalize on the fact that she and  Gossip Girls Leighton Meester look  uncannily similar  also add roles on network TV shows like  NBC's Parenthood and ABC's ill-fated  Charlie's Angels reboot but she really  didn't have another noteworthy gig until  she played dove on DC's Titans in 2018  Boy Wonder  while Kelly has managed to fly below the  radar in terms of filmography she has  stayed in the tabloids for other reasons  namely her love life much like Lyla  Garrity  Kelly's dating life has been a bit of a  roller coaster over the past decade  she's been linked to an abundance of  celebrities ranging from Chris Evans to  Sean Penn  sounds like Lila doesn't just have eyes  for football players after all although  it's been several years since her last  time playing Tyra Collette Adrianne  Palicki still has her own ideas on where  she thinks Dillon's resident bad girl  would be today  she told Texas Monthly Riggins is still  in Dillon Texas and married to Tyra  they're a messed-up version of Coach and  Tami because he still Riggs but he's  coaching and she's now the counselor  it's the next evolution while it may  have been tough to say farewell to the  angsty Texas teen Palicki has achieved a  respectable career since her time on  Friday Night Lights especially in the  butt-kicking genre she starred in 2012  Spore Lee reviewed remake of Red Dawn  before appearing in major action  blockbusters GI Joe retaliation and John  wick and she also gained notoriety by  playing fan favorite super heroine  Mockingbird on ABC's agents of shield  most recently the Legion vet has been  showcasing her comedic prowess alongside  Family Guy Seth MacFarlane on Fox's Star  Trek spoof the Orville s commander Kelly  Grayson Palicki plays the first officer  and ex-wife of McFarland's captain Edie  Mercer although the show takes place in  outer space certain aspects of it feels  similar to the Dillon High alum she told  Vanity Fair I can compare this to Friday  Night Lights in a sense the reason it's  so grounded is because it's grounded in  reality you could be taking us off the  spaceship and have the exact same  situations happen from rural Texas to  outer space there's apparently no  telling how high Tyra Collette will fly  in the first episode of Friday Night  Lights Matt Saracen a shy awkward nobody  gets a chance to shine as the Dillon  Panthers quarterback much like his  character it was also Zach Gilford first  opportunity to show what he could do s  listen Guilford captured the essence of  a high school average Joe and really  became one of the more relatable  characters on the show your dad's not  able to see what I see your different  kids in you were two weeks ago you are  perhaps it was this natural underdog  quality that helped him land roles in  various projects after Friday Night  Lights wrapped including horror flicks  the purge anarchy and Devils do while  Finn roles are all well and good you  have to imagine that one of Guilford's  most unique credits was playing the  boyfriend in Taylor Swift's music video  for her song hours most recently you can  see Gilford on NBC's good girls where he  plays Mae Whitman's ex-husband Greg it's  good to see that Matt returned to his  home network Dallas born actor Jesse  Plemons may have been an unknown when he  first played lovable loser turned high  school jock Landry Clarke in Friday  Night Lights but that isn't the case  anymore the emmy-nominated star has been  all over the map since 2011 with a wide  ranging acting resume  aside from Landry he is perhaps most  recognized as sadistic Todd Jesse  pinkman's captor and torturer in the  wildly popular Breaking Bad but he has  also played prominent roles on the big  screen starring in movies like Black  Mass bridge of spies and game night  Clemens was also one of the lead  characters on the second season of FX's  anthology series Fargo while the show  brought his career success in many  facets including his first Emmy  nomination it also greatly enhanced his  personal life by introducing him to his  co-star and future fiance spider-man  star Kirsten Dunst the two were engaged  in January of 2017 and welcomed their  first son Ennis in mid 2018 while  Plemons stays busy in Hollywood most  recently appearing in Netflix's  oscar-nominated gangster movie the  Irishman he's loving fatherhood saying  it's the best man it's so hard to put  into words all the clichés are true what  every parent tells you coach Taylor  would be proud Aimee Teegarden was only  16 when she was cast as Julie Taylor the  strong-willed daughter of coach Eric and  Tami Taylor and Friday Night Lights  although it was her first pilot she had  enough advice from some of her more  experienced co-stars to know that the  show was a rare opportunity  she told nylon Kyle Chandler I remember  he used to say to us you kids you have  no idea how  good you have it you have no idea so I  think at the time we all kind of just  really tried to enjoy it as much as  possible and it was just such a special  show and it was an amazing time in my  life since Friday Night Lights ended  Teegarden has kept one foot in network  television first starring as Emory  whitehill on CW's romantic sci-fi series  star-crossed and then as Ella Benjamin  on ABC's notorious although her film  career never really caught fire she has  popped up in the occasional horror movie  including 2011 scream 4 and 2007 teens  rings and she recently starred in the  2009 teen hallmark movie once upon a  Christmas miracle out of all the Friday  Night Lights stars Teegarden arguably  looks the most different today in fact  most people apparently don't recognize  her if they see her about she told Fox 4  1 1 it's funny it takes people a hot  second to recognize me because when I  was in Friday Night Lights I had super  blonde hair and bangs and I was 16 when  I started that show poor Jason Street  the one time quarterback had such a  promising future ahead of him prior to  his devastating injury and Friday Night  Lights pilot placing him in a wheelchair  for the remainder of the show  fortunately for Scott Porter the actor  playing Street Friday Night Lights was  just the beginning of a highly  successful acting career porter  officially hung up his cleats after the  series third season but he did come back  to make an appearance in season 5 after  that he continued to work in TV most  notably as George Tucker in Heart of  Dixie he has also appeared in a plethora  of movies throughout the years including  prom night and Speed Racer  while the Nebraskan actor has shared on  screen steamy scenes with Minka Kelly  and Rachel Bilson when the camera goes  off he has a devoted happily married  husband and father in 2013 his wife  Kelsey Mayfield Porter was diagnosed  with Huntington's disease a serious  neurological condition that affects  brain cells in response the couple has  been working to raise awareness and more  importantly how to end the disease  Porter revealed I want them to know that  you don't have to pass the gene down we  did something called PGD IVF it's  genetic testing for embryos and you can  make sure that you don't pass it down  any longer mccoy my son is clean that  Huntington's gene will end with my wife  as Brian smash Williams guys Charles got  to channel his inner boobie miles to  portray a talented yet egotistical  athlete how  the actor in real life is apparently  very different from his on-screen  counterpart according to Charles when we  all first got cast we all went out to  lunch with executive producer Peter Berg  we're talking and talking he goes you're  really different from your character I  mean really different and I'm like okay  so should I get my burger to go am I  fired since Friday Night Lights the New  York City bred actor has held minor  roles in several movies and television  shows he appeared in 2010 Sault  alongside Angelina Jolie and more  recently an NBC spin-off prequel series  taken but Gaius is perhaps best known  for playing dr. Shane Ross in the later  seasons of ABC's Grey's Anatomy we can't  wait to see what he does next check out  one of our newest videos right here Plus  even more looper videos about your  favorite stars are coming soon subscribe  to our YouTube channel and hit the bell  so you don't miss a single one  [Music]

